WEBVTT

1
00:00:09,970 --> 00:00:11,770
She was planning to enter the boss's bedroom

2
00:00:12,270 --> 00:00:13,770
Cai Lu fell into a trap and was solved

3
00:00:14,170 --> 00:00:16,670
During the day, I heard Shen Wanyue say that the boss is not allowed to enter the room.

4
00:00:17,170 --> 00:00:19,470
I was thinking about sneaking in in the middle of the night

5
00:00:19,970 --> 00:00:21,570
Fortunately, I was too tired at night

6
00:00:21,970 --> 00:00:24,170
I forgot about it I guess

7
00:00:24,470 --> 00:00:27,820
What does Lin Dong mean by warning us?

8
00:00:28,220 --> 00:00:29,420
She accepted Li Xiaoyan

9
00:00:29,820 --> 00:00:31,620
Probably because she would break the rules

10
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,820
That's why she ended up like this

11
00:00:34,930 --> 00:00:36,730
Lin Dong used Li Xiaoyan to warn us

12
00:00:37,030 --> 00:00:38,130
It's okay not to follow the rules

13
00:00:38,630 --> 00:00:40,130
But you must bear the corresponding consequences

14
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,120
So that's it

15
00:00:43,520 --> 00:00:45,120
I will obey the rules obediently

16
00:00:58,780 --> 00:01:03,260
I understand that tonight's events must not be mentioned to anyone.
